<script setup>
import { moods } from '../../config/moods.js'
const props=defineProps({view:{type:Object,required:true},devices:{type:Array,default:()=>[]},selectedDevices:{type:Object,default:()=>({})},deviceBusy:Boolean,professional:Boolean,roomMood:String,background:{type:Object,default:()=>({})},network:{type:Object,default:()=>({})}})
const emit=defineEmits(['view','device','refresh-devices','fullscreen','invite','copy-room-id','background','background-image','low-data'])
const layouts=[['gallery','Gallery'],['speaker','Speaker'],['dynamic','Dynamic gallery'],['multi','Multi-speaker'],['immersive','Retro lounge']]
const deviceKinds=[['audioinput','Mikrofon'],['videoinput','Kamera'],['audiooutput','Speaker']]
const supportsOutput=typeof HTMLMediaElement!=='undefined' && 'setSinkId' in HTMLMediaElement.prototype
</script>
<template><div class="meeting-settings"><h3>▦ Tampilan meeting</h3><label class="setting-field">Layout<select :value="view.layout" @change="emit('view',{layout:$event.target.value})"><option v-for="[id,label] in layouts" :key="id" :value="id">{{label}}</option></select></label><label class="setting-check"><input type="checkbox" :checked="view.hideSelf" @change="emit('view',{hideSelf:$event.target.checked})" /> Sembunyikan video saya</label><label class="setting-check"><input type="checkbox" :checked="view.hideNoVideo" @change="emit('view',{hideNoVideo:$event.target.checked})" /> Sembunyikan peserta tanpa video</label><button v-if="view.pinnedId" @click="emit('view',{pinnedId:''})">Lepas pin peserta</button>
  <label class="setting-field">Fokus layar<select :value="view.content || 'activity'" @change="emit('view',{content:$event.target.value})"><option value="activity">Aktivitas room / share screen</option><option value="cameras">Kamera peserta</option></select></label>
  <label class="setting-check"><input type="checkbox" :checked="view.showTimer" @change="emit('view',{showTimer:$event.target.checked})" /> Tampilkan durasi room</label>
  <label class="setting-field">Background ruang<select :value="view.background" @change="emit('view',{background:$event.target.value})"><option value="default">Mood room · {{moods[roomMood]?.name || 'Default'}}</option><option v-for="(mood,id) in moods" :key="id" :value="id">{{mood.icon}} {{mood.name}}</option></select></label><small>Pengaturan tampilan hanya untukmu.</small>
  <h3>▧ Background kamera</h3>
  <label class="setting-field">Efek kamera<select :value="background.mode || 'none'" :disabled="background.busy" @change="emit('background',$event.target.value)"><option value="none">Tanpa efek</option><option value="blur">Blur background</option><option v-if="background.imageName" value="image">{{background.imageName}}</option></select></label>
  <label class="setting-field">Tambah gambar<input type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" :disabled="background.busy" @change="emit('background-image',$event.target.files?.[0]);$event.target.value=''" /></label>
  <small>{{background.busy?'Memproses background…':'Gambar JPG, PNG, WebP maksimal 5 MB. Diproses di perangkatmu; hasil kamera terlihat oleh peserta lain. Efek diterapkan saat kamera aktif.'}}</small>
  <small v-if="background.supported===false">Browser ini belum mendukung efek kamera.</small>
  <h3>◉ Koneksi</h3>
  <label class="setting-check"><input type="checkbox" :checked="network.lowData" :disabled="network.busy" @change="emit('low-data',$event.target.checked)" /> Hemat data video</label>
  <small>Menurunkan resolusi kamera dan kualitas video yang diterima. Audio tetap aktif. Matikan efek kamera jika perangkat terasa berat.</small>
  <dl class="network-stats"><dt>RTT media</dt><dd>{{network.rttMs==null?'Belum tersedia':network.rttMs+' ms'}}</dd><dt>Jitter terima</dt><dd>{{network.jitterMs==null?'Belum tersedia':network.jitterMs+' ms'}}</dd><dt>Packet loss terima</dt><dd>{{network.packetLoss==null?'Belum tersedia':network.packetLoss+'%'}}</dd></dl><small>Statistik WebRTC diperbarui setiap 5 detik. RTT adalah perjalanan pulang-pergi ke server media, bukan total keterlambatan kamera ke layar.</small>
  <h3>🎙 Perangkat</h3><label v-for="[kind,label] in deviceKinds.filter(([kind])=>kind!=='audiooutput'||supportsOutput)" :key="kind" class="setting-field">{{label}}<select :value="selectedDevices[kind] || 'default'" :disabled="deviceBusy" @change="emit('device',{kind,id:$event.target.value})"><option value="default">Default browser</option><option v-for="(device,index) in devices.filter(d=>d.kind===kind && d.deviceId && d.deviceId!=='default')" :key="device.deviceId" :value="device.deviceId">{{device.label || `${label} ${index+1}`}}</option></select></label><small>Aktifkan kamera/mikrofon untuk melihat nama perangkat. Speaker bergantung dukungan browser.</small><button @click="emit('refresh-devices')">Refresh perangkat ↻</button>
  <h3>✦ Lainnya</h3><button @click="emit('invite')">Salin undangan ↗</button><button @click="emit('copy-room-id')">Salin Meeting ID ▣</button><button @click="emit('fullscreen')">Fullscreen ⛶</button>
</div></template>
<style scoped>
.meeting-settings{padding:18px;display:grid;gap:14px}h3{font-size:19px;margin:5px 0}.setting-field{display:grid;gap:7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}select{width:100%;padding:10px;background:var(--bg-app);color:var(--text-primary);border:2px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:9px}.setting-check{display:flex;align-items:start;gap:9px;font-size:12px}.setting-check input{accent-color:var(--color-primary);width:16px;height:16px;flex:none;margin-top:2px}small{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-secondary)}button{padding:9px 12px;border:2px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:9px;background:var(--bg-elevated);color:var(--text-primary);font-weight:900;text-align:left;font-size:12px}
</style>

<style scoped>.network-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:6px;margin:0;font-size:11px}.network-stats dd{margin:0;font-weight:800}input[type=file]{width:100%;font-size:11px}</style>
